<lg label="2."><l>God of glory, we bow the knee,</l><l>Grant us today</l><l>Spir’t of wisdom, revelation,</l><l>The mystery to see,</l><l>I’d outpour all my life for Thine economy,</l><l>Just for Thine eternal pleasure,</l><l>The Body of Christ,</l><l>In my mingled spirit lead me</l><l>To the Body’s reality,</l><l>In Thine intensification</l><l>Make us the testimony of Jesus</l><l>O Lord! For this we yearn!</l><l>Quickly come, as once Thou promised!</l><l>Lord, our deepest longing</l><l>Is Thy return!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
